    "Study permits and registering with the police – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nStudy permits and registering with the police\nStudents from EU/EEA/Switzerland\nStudents from the EU/EEA/Switzerland must register with the police when arriving in Norway.\nStudents from non-EU/EEA countries\nStudents from outside the EU/EEA must apply for a residence permit immediately after receiving their Admission letter.\nWork permit\nIf you are granted a study permit, you automatically also granted permission to work part-time.\nPublished\nSep. 3, 2020 10:44 AM\n-\nLast modified\nJune 16, 2025 2:37 PM\nE-mail this page\nShare on Facebook\nShare on X"
